          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "macOS 正在以受保护的临时副本运行 ClashMax，它无法自行移动。请在访达中把 ClashMax 拖到「应用程序」文件夹，然后从那里打开。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "macOS is running ClashMax from a temporary read-only copy, which it will not let install a privileged helper. Drag ClashMax into your Applications folder in Finder, then open it from there." : {
