        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "该连接携带 %@，因此域名规则可以命中它。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This connection was opened straight to %@ with no domain, and %@ matches the sniffer's %@ list, so it was deliberately left alone." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "base" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "This connection was opened straight to %@ with no domain, and %@ matches the sniffer's %@ list, so it was deliberately left alone."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "该连接直接连往 %@ 且不携带域名，而 %@ 命中了嗅探的 %@ 列表，因此被有意跳过。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This connection was opened straight to %@ with no domain, before the current sniffer settings took effect, so they say nothing about it." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "base" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "This connection was opened straight to %@ with no domain, before the current sniffer settings took effect, so they say nothing about it."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "该连接直接连往 %@ 且不携带域名，建立于当前嗅探设置生效之前，因此这些设置无法说明它的情况。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This connection was opened straight to %@ with no domain, so DOMAIN, DOMAIN-SUFFIX, DOMAIN-KEYWORD and GEOSITE rules cannot match it. Sniffing is off, so no name is recovered." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "base" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "This connection was opened straight to %@ with no domain, so DOMAIN, DOMAIN-SUFFIX, DOMAIN-KEYWORD and GEOSITE rules cannot match it. Sniffing is off, so no name is recovered."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "该连接直接连往 %@，不携带域名，因此 DOMAIN、DOMAIN-SUFFIX、DOMAIN-KEYWORD 和 GEOSITE 规则都无法命中它。嗅探已关闭，也不会找回域名。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This connection was opened straight to %@ with no domain. ClashMax has not read the running sniffer configuration, so it cannot say whether a name could have been recovered." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "base" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "This connection was opened straight to %@ with no domain. ClashMax has not read the running sniffer configuration, so it cannot say whether a name could have been recovered."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "该连接直接连往 %@，不携带域名。ClashMax 尚未读取正在运行的嗅探配置，因此无法判断是否本可以找回域名。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This connection was opened straight to %@ with no domain. Sniffing covers it and still recovered no name, so the traffic carries none — match it with IP-CIDR, GEOIP, DST-PORT or process rules instead." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "base" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "This connection was opened straight to %@ with no domain. Sniffing covers it and still recovered no name, so the traffic carries none — match it with IP-CIDR, GEOIP, DST-PORT or process rules instead."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "该连接直接连往 %@，不携带域名。嗅探已覆盖它却仍未找回任何名称，说明流量本身就不含域名——请改用 IP-CIDR、GEOIP、DST-PORT 或进程规则来匹配。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This connection was opened straight to %@ with no domain. Sniffing is on, but no sniff entry covers %@ %@, so nothing looked at it." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "base" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "This connection was opened straight to %@ with no domain. Sniffing is on, but no sniff entry covers %@ %@, so nothing looked at it."
